name=HARMONIE - SVU3 Sandbox
id=HARMONIE_SVU3Sandbox
description=Adds a sandbox multiplier for how much condition Standardized Vehicle Upgrades 3's own protection/armor add-on parts (bullbars, window/door/trunk armor, wheel chains) lose each time they absorb damage for the vehicle part they protect. SVU3 ships fixed per-tier values with no overall multiplier -- this adds one, so those parts can be made to break down faster (or slower) than SVU3's own defaults. Also scales the skill levels an upgrade needs to install by the vehicle's tier (weight and front/rear strength; 3 tiers, the lowest at 50%) and caps their total (default 14). Requires tsarslib, Standardized Vehicle Upgrades 3 (Core) and Standardized Vehicle Upgrades 3 (Vanilla).
poster=poster.png
icon=icon.png
modversion=0.3.0
versionMin=42.0.0
require=tsarslib,StandardizedVehicleUpgrades3Core,StandardizedVehicleUpgrades3V
